Entity:
- `id`: Unique integer identifier (0, 1, 2…).
- `name`: Full name of the entity.
- `label`: `person`|`animal`.

Relationship:
- `source_id`: `id` of the subject entity.
- `link`: `snake_case` predicate describing the relationship.
- `target_id`: `id` of the object entity.

